#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "execute {#execute}"
msgstr "execute {#execute}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The `qiskit.execute` function is not available in Qiskit v1.0. This\n"
"function served as a high-level wrapper around the\n"
"[`transpile`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/compiler#transpile) and\n"
"[`run`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.providers.BackendV2#run) functions in Qiskit.\n"
"Instead of `qiskit.execute`, use the\n"
"[`transpile`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/compiler#transpile) function followed by\n"
"[`backend.run()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.providers.BackendV2#run).\n"
msgstr ""
"Fungsi `qiskit.execute` tidak tersedia di Qiskit v1.0. Fungsi ini\n"
"berperan sebagai wrapper tingkat tinggi di sekitar fungsi\n"
"[`transpile`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/compiler#transpile) dan\n"
"[`run`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.providers.BackendV2#run) di Qiskit.\n"
"Alih-alih `qiskit.execute`, gunakan fungsi\n"
"[`transpile`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/compiler#transpile) diikuti oleh\n"
"[`backend.run()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.providers.BackendV2#run).\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Alternatively, the [Sampler](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/1.4/qiskit.primitives.Sampler)\n"
"primitive is semantically equivalent to the removed `qiskit.execute`\n"
"function. The class\n"
"[`BackendSampler`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/1.4/qiskit.primitives.BackendSampler) is a\n"
"generic wrapper for backends that do not support primitives:\n"
msgstr ""
"Alternatifnya, primitif [Sampler](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/1.4/qiskit.primitives.Sampler)\n"
"secara semantis setara dengan fungsi `qiskit.execute` yang sudah dihapus.\n"
"Kelas [`BackendSampler`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/1.4/qiskit.primitives.BackendSampler) adalah\n"
"wrapper generik untuk Backend yang tidak mendukung primitif:\n"

