# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Importing from `qiskit.providers.aer` is no longer possible. Instead, import\n"
"from `qiskit_aer`, which is a drop-in replacement. To install `qiskit_aer`,\n"
"run:\n"
msgstr ""
"Mengimpor dari `qiskit.providers.aer` tidak lagi memungkinkan. Sebagai gantinya, impor\n"
"dari `qiskit_aer`, yang merupakan pengganti langsung. Untuk menginstall `qiskit_aer`,\n"
"jalankan:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ```bash\n"
"    pip install qiskit-aer\n"
"    ```\n"
msgstr ""
"    ```bash\n"
"    pip install qiskit-aer\n"
"    ```\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Support for running pulse jobs on backends from\n"
"[`qiskit.providers.fake_provider`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/providers_fake_provider) has\n"
"been removed in Qiskit v1.0.  This is because Qiskit Aer removed its\n"
"simulation functionality for such jobs.  For low-level Hamiltonian-simulation\n"
"workloads, consider using a specialized library such as [Qiskit\n"
"Dynamics](https://qiskit-extensions.github.io/qiskit-dynamics/).\n"
msgstr ""
"Dukungan untuk menjalankan pulse job pada Backend dari\n"
"[`qiskit.providers.fake_provider`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/providers_fake_provider) telah\n"
"dihapus di Qiskit v1.0. Ini karena Qiskit Aer menghapus\n"
"fungsionalitas simulasi untuk job semacam itu. Untuk beban kerja simulasi Hamiltonian tingkat rendah,\n"
"pertimbangkan menggunakan library khusus seperti [Qiskit\n"
"Dynamics](https://qiskit-extensions.github.io/qiskit-dynamics/).\n"

