"`pulse.library.parametric_pulses.ParametricPulse` | [`qiskit.pulse.SymbolicPulse`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/1.4/qiskit.pulse.library.SymbolicPulse)\n"
"`pulse.library.parametric_pulses.Constant` |  [`pulse.library.symbolic_pulses.Constant`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/1.4/qiskit.pulse.library.Constant)\n"
"`pulse.library.parametric_pulses.Drag` |  [`pulse.library.symbolic_pulses.Drag`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/1.4/qiskit.pulse.library.Drag)\n"
"`pulse.library.parametric_pulses.Gaussian` |  [`pulse.library.symbolic_pulses.Gaussian`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/1.4/qiskit.pulse.library.Gaussian)\n"
"`qiskit.pulse.library.parametric_pulses.GaussianSquare` |  [`pulse.library.symbolic_pulses.GaussianSquare`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/1.4/qiskit.pulse.library.GaussianSquare)\n"
msgstr ""
"Dihapus                          |   Alternatif\n"
"---------------------------------|--------------------------------------------\n"
"`pulse.library.parametric_pulses.ParametricPulse` | [`qiskit.pulse.SymbolicPulse`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/1.4/qiskit.pulse.library.SymbolicPulse)\n"
"`pulse.library.parametric_pulses.Constant` |  [`pulse.library.symbolic_pulses.Constant`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/1.4/qiskit.pulse.library.Constant)\n"
"`pulse.library.parametric_pulses.Drag` |  [`pulse.library.symbolic_pulses.Drag`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/1.4/qiskit.pulse.library.Drag)\n"
"`pulse.library.parametric_pulses.Gaussian` |  [`pulse.library.symbolic_pulses.Gaussian`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/1.4/qiskit.pulse.library.Gaussian)\n"
"`qiskit.pulse.library.parametric_pulses.GaussianSquare` |  [`pulse.library.symbolic_pulses.GaussianSquare`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/1.4/qiskit.pulse.library.GaussianSquare)\n"

