#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The `qiskit.tools.jupyter` submodule has been removed because the functionality\n"
"in this module is tied to the legacy `qiskit-ibmq-provider` package, which is no\n"
"longer supported. It also only supported `BackendV1` and not the newer\n"
"[`BackendV2`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.providers.BackendV2) interface.\n"
msgstr ""
"Submodul `qiskit.tools.jupyter` telah dihapus karena fungsionalitas\n"
"dalam modul ini terkait dengan paket `qiskit-ibmq-provider` lawas, yang\n"
"sudah tidak didukung lagi. Submodul ini juga hanya mendukung `BackendV1` dan bukan antarmuka\n"
"[`BackendV2`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.providers.BackendV2) yang lebih baru.\n"

