#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"These functions were used exclusively in the `qiskit.algorithms` and\n"
"`qiskit.opflow` modules, which have also been removed.\n"
msgstr ""
"Fungsi-fungsi ini hanya digunakan di modul `qiskit.algorithms` dan\n"
"`qiskit.opflow`, yang juga sudah dihapus.\n"

